  <metadata><name>Emigrant Lake Trail — Caples Lake, Highway 88</name><desc>On-foot hiking route. Dense points trace the actual trail (OpenStreetMap trail data, Nov 15, 2026) so the route follows the footpath, not roads. Traced from the mapped Emigrant Lake Trail, which starts at the west end of Caples Lake. Simplified to at most 150 points total for inRoute's waypoint limit; the line still follows the trail.</desc><time>2026-11-15T18:40:00Z</time></metadata>
